discussion Mr. McClure was having with his wife about what they were trying to do.

03:23:12.720 --> 03:23:16.710
I'll go with his opinion right now, traced over mine.

03:23:16.710 --> 03:23:20.710
Brad Watson has left us to go back over closer to get some information.

03:23:20.710 --> 03:23:24.840
Bill Brown's circulating, too, so if we hear anything, we'll know about it here.

03:23:24.840 --> 03:23:28.740
Well, it would make sense, wouldn't it, that they wouldn't necessarily have obstetric forceps

03:23:28.740 --> 03:23:30.000
at the site.

03:23:30.000 --> 03:23:32.300
and that might be something they don't have to send away for.

03:23:32.300 --> 03:23:37.940
And if the paramedic could not get a close look before because of the size of the hole

03:23:37.940 --> 03:23:42.880
or whatever, if this was the expert's first, or maybe it was the pediatrician, I don't

03:23:42.880 --> 03:23:46.760
know, one of the medical people, if it was their first chance to really see her, see

03:23:46.760 --> 03:23:51.370
how she's wedged, see where she is, then they'd be calling for stuff that, of course, they

03:23:51.370 --> 03:23:52.750
couldn't have anticipated before.

03:23:53.540 --> 03:24:00.000
The police chief was telling me that they couldn't see her face earlier today, even when

03:24:00.000 --> 03:24:01.420
And they tried to get up with her.

03:24:01.420 --> 03:24:04.940
So if they've been able to see more of her and get a better idea of what her situation

03:24:04.940 --> 03:24:08.560
is, only now are they getting an idea of how easy it will be to get this out.

03:24:08.560 --> 03:24:10.760
This might be good news, David.

03:24:10.760 --> 03:24:12.550
Did you see what they're dropping into the hole?

03:24:12.550 --> 03:24:13.530
No.

03:24:13.530 --> 03:24:19.110
It looked as though it could be -- it looked like the backboard that -- in fact, we're

03:24:19.110 --> 03:24:23.570
pretty sure that it is the backboard that would have to be used to bring Jessica up.

03:24:23.570 --> 03:24:24.570
And that's what --

03:24:24.570 --> 03:24:27.730
If it's the backboard, then we're getting close.

03:24:27.730 --> 03:24:29.670
They said they wouldn't lower that in there.

03:24:30.000 --> 03:24:33.120
so they needed it, which I guess is an obvious thing to say, but I don't think they'd be

03:24:33.120 --> 03:24:35.860
sending it down there just to have it sit around the cave wall. I think they would be

03:24:35.860 --> 03:24:43.250
needing to use it. So, boy, am I reluctant to get too positive. I know people have been

03:24:43.250 --> 03:24:48.310
following this closely, and I have an impression that many have. Their feelings and emotions

03:24:48.310 --> 03:24:53.880
about this have risen and fallen with everybody else's. If there were people today listening

03:24:53.880 --> 03:25:00.000
to the radio around noontime or watching us or someone else on television, it sure looked

03:25:00.060 --> 03:25:06.860
better now um so so this is this is awfully uh awfully encouraging i hope we'll get some word

03:25:06.860 --> 03:25:10.720
from one of our other reporters about what they're seeing close up or or what's getting

03:25:10.720 --> 03:25:14.680
communicated to them i would think if they're this getting this close that that may be uh

03:25:14.680 --> 03:25:18.540
something we can find out but that's an awfully good sign there's this gentleman i see a gentleman

03:25:18.540 --> 03:25:24.160
now with a messing and i'm messing with excuse me bad grammar a rope doing something with the rope

03:25:24.160 --> 03:25:30.000
again it it appears to me they're making some kind of pulley is that possible it's an

03:25:30.000 --> 03:25:32.320
They have attached it to a blue hook of some kind.

03:25:32.400 --> 03:25:33.020
Yeah, okay.

03:25:33.750 --> 03:25:36.730
If that's the case, then maybe they're planning to bring her up with the pulley.

03:25:37.330 --> 03:25:39.130
I never really thought about how they would do it.

03:25:39.170 --> 03:25:42.390
I guess I kind of thought they'd carry her out on the backboard.

03:25:43.260 --> 03:25:46.300
But the pulley's getting engaged here for some reason.

03:25:46.760 --> 03:25:48.860
You can certainly, I don't know if you can see these fellas' faces,

03:25:48.860 --> 03:25:53.460
but, boy, they're more animated than they've been at earlier times today.

03:25:53.680 --> 03:25:57.120
I don't know if it's, you talk about the frustration of the parents, Trace.

03:25:57.180 --> 03:26:00.000
You've got firefighters who are used to going into buildings, restaurants.

03:26:00.000 --> 03:26:03.780
rescuing babies and policemen who do that sort of thing, too, and all the things they

03:26:03.780 --> 03:26:04.780
run into.

03:26:04.780 --> 03:26:06.760
And they haven't been able to do much of anything.

03:26:06.760 --> 03:26:10.240
They weren't even able to go down and dig because you have expert diggers out here in

03:26:10.240 --> 03:26:13.360
well country who know more about digging.

03:26:13.360 --> 03:26:19.890
So these guys who've been here, some of them straight through for all 57 hours, whatever

03:26:19.890 --> 03:26:24.920
it is, they're probably relieved to seeing some activity that they can relate to.

03:26:24.920 --> 03:26:30.000
They've pulled people out on stretchers and things like that before, if that indeed is

03:26:30.000 --> 03:26:34.930
going on and it sure looks that way doesn't it wish we had a live camera down inside that shaft

03:26:34.930 --> 03:26:39.650
dave so we could see what's taking place we do earlier today so if people were watching we made

03:26:39.650 --> 03:26:45.440
a big deal of the fact that around a little before noon they allowed cameras to come in around the

03:26:45.440 --> 03:26:51.180
hole a few feet back and we've been told if that happens boy this could be it about five o'clock

03:26:51.180 --> 03:26:55.840
they moved those cameras and said we're not sure it's a real good idea to have you in here after

03:26:55.840 --> 03:27:00.000
all and they put them up on a truck

03:27:00.000 --> 03:27:07.370
some kind. One of those cameras up there is a Channel 8 camera being operated by KMID

03:27:07.370 --> 03:27:11.710
here as part of our agreement to try to help each other get the best pictures possible.

03:27:11.710 --> 03:27:15.870
So the fellows who were down around the edge showing us the close-up pictures of faces

03:27:15.870 --> 03:27:20.830
and things around lunchtime are now up above. That accounts for those of you who watch television

03:27:20.830 --> 03:27:24.390
closely, that accounts for the difference in the angle you're seeing. We're not seeing

03:27:24.390 --> 03:27:27.430
too much ground level right now, we're seeing from above.

03:27:27.430 --> 03:27:30.000
There are two or three cameras all tied into the same system.

03:27:30.000 --> 03:27:33.420
we're using. I assume you guys have been flicking those back and forth a little bit.

03:27:34.570 --> 03:27:38.790
Yes, we have, Dave. There was a, you know, the person who looked as though she might

03:27:38.790 --> 03:27:43.070
be a nurse or a paramedic or perhaps a doctor, it looked to me just a couple of moments ago

03:27:43.070 --> 03:27:48.510
as though she was down at the top of that hole. Now, look, here's a group of folk look

03:27:48.510 --> 03:27:54.960
like perhaps they might be medical types who are standing there waiting. So I, it would

03:27:54.960 --> 03:28:00.000
appear just from these signs, Dave, and again, just trying to, as you keep saying, and

03:28:00.000 --> 03:28:06.520
and rightfully so. We're not trying to get folks' hopes up, but we are trying to determine

03:28:06.520 --> 03:28:12.910
exactly what is taking place here. And if this person is, well, it looks like she's

03:28:12.910 --> 03:28:16.570
fairly animated too, as though she has something on her mind that she's trying to share with

03:28:16.570 --> 03:28:22.480
these other folks around her, and they're throwing into action now the plan that they

03:28:22.480 --> 03:28:26.220
would have to retrieve Jessica from the shaft.

03:28:26.220 --> 03:28:30.000
Now other activity around the mouth of that area and around the top of this thing is

03:28:30.000 --> 03:28:34.210
just suddenly come to a standstill, David. Now, you're the person who's been there. There

03:28:34.210 --> 03:28:37.710
has, I think, been a great deal of activity all day long. So again, the fact that it's

03:28:37.710 --> 03:28:41.850
come to a standstill would lend credence to what we're saying now.

03:28:41.850 --> 03:28:47.140
That's a good sign. Most of the activity has been the guys with the drills or the fellas

03:28:47.140 --> 03:28:52.310
with the high-pressure water drills, all the stuff that you had to do before you could

03:28:52.310 --> 03:29:00.000
even try to go in and help her. Now, we're not seeing that. Kenneth Carr, I believe his

03:29:00.000 --> 03:29:05.290
But one of the diggers went in to enlarge, I believe he said, the left side of that hole

03:29:05.290 --> 03:29:07.140
in order to make it large enough to get her out.

03:29:07.740 --> 03:29:09.480
Or at least that was the supposition on his part.

03:29:10.170 --> 03:29:16.440
So if all they have left to do, the diggers, that is, is last-minute stuff like that,

03:29:16.480 --> 03:29:17.700
that would also be a good sign.

03:29:18.420 --> 03:29:23.400
You know, when they brought that hydro drill in earlier, David, we didn't realize it at the time.

03:29:23.480 --> 03:29:27.250
I know we were talking about how much faster it was going to be able to clear away that rock.

03:29:27.250 --> 03:29:30.000
But we have word now that it was able to...

03:29:30.160 --> 03:29:36.720
save about 10 hours of additional work i i think that's that that may be a fair country estimate

03:29:36.720 --> 03:29:41.940
out here uh they were saying to us if only we had this yesterday but i think part of the problem is

03:29:41.940 --> 03:29:46.980
this doesn't happen very often uh while they do a lot of drilling out here it's it's different sorts

03:29:46.980 --> 03:29:51.220
of wells and and they don't they don't you know how often does a little girl get stuck 22 feet

03:29:51.220 --> 03:29:57.140
below ground and then how often if you do have to dig down 22 feet say in dallas fort worth or

03:29:57.140 --> 03:30:00.000
someplace else how often do you hit solid rock as you

03:30:00.000 --> 03:30:08.530
try to get over to something underground like that um so they were very successful i would think

03:30:08.530 --> 03:30:18.570
for me at least the lowest moment of this entire experience was after the noontime buildup and then

03:30:18.570 --> 03:30:23.430
it just looked they were saying they had to move more rock and it was like oh my lord is it going

03:30:23.430 --> 03:30:30.000
to be another all-nighter or even longer but that may have been the most productive digging apparently

03:30:30.000 --> 03:30:33.120
Watson, who's pretty good at putting these in terms people can understand, was saying

03:30:33.120 --> 03:30:37.080
that it's like when you have your backyard garden hose and you put it on the very strongest,

03:30:37.080 --> 03:30:42.890
most direct line spray instead of the kind of thing you do to water the daisies.

03:30:42.890 --> 03:30:47.290
If you put that on mud, you're going to dig a little ditch in that mud, and it's the same

03:30:47.290 --> 03:30:53.050
principle with the kind of rock Brad was describing earlier here, that that stuff was like the

03:30:53.050 --> 03:31:00.000
water came out at such incredible speed, 32,000 pounds per square inch or something along that.

03:31:00.000 --> 03:31:05.710
got that wrong but that's something very hard for us that it was able to dig into that.

03:31:05.710 --> 03:31:09.050
Mrs. McClure has just stood up. Her husband has stood up. We've seen some very dramatic

03:31:09.050 --> 03:31:14.130
pictures, very touching pictures I might say of Mr. and Mrs. McClure. He had his arm around

03:31:14.130 --> 03:31:19.290
her earlier and they are moving now perhaps a little bit closer to the hole. David, I

03:31:19.290 --> 03:31:23.390
don't know if you can see these pictures. I can. Yeah, I wasn't, I was talking and I'm

03:31:23.390 --> 03:31:25.590
looking. They're getting chairs for them. I think that's what they've done. They were

03:31:25.590 --> 03:31:28.820
sitting on the ground there and I think they finally brought some chairs over. So maybe

03:31:28.820 --> 03:31:30.000
that means that they're in for the dual

03:31:30.000 --> 03:31:35.250
Well, my concern was they were kind of heading toward that yellow police rope, and I thought

03:31:35.250 --> 03:31:39.130
if they're leaving, we're in trouble, or their daughter's in trouble, or it means they may

03:31:39.130 --> 03:31:40.290
have to be let down again.

03:31:40.290 --> 03:31:45.450
But I think I just saw her plop down on what looks like a chair, so that means that they're

03:31:45.450 --> 03:31:46.450
not going over to the hole.

03:31:46.450 --> 03:31:48.850
It doesn't mean their daughter's coming out this second, but it also doesn't mean that

03:31:48.850 --> 03:31:50.730
it's over, that it's another disappointment.

03:31:50.730 --> 03:31:52.860
So that's nice to see.

03:31:52.860 --> 03:31:56.390
These photographs are almost like thumbing through an old life magazine.

03:31:56.390 --> 03:32:00.000
Very dramatic pictures, Dave, of the faces of Mr. and Mrs. McKeown.

03:32:00.000 --> 03:32:06.550
Kluwer, a very nice looking couple, and these smiles, I think for all of us, have to be

03:32:06.550 --> 03:32:10.570
cheering. They would not be smiling unless the news coming to them quite obviously was

03:32:10.570 --> 03:32:14.990
good news. So that's good news for all of us. I don't want to read too much, of course,

03:32:15.050 --> 03:32:19.690
into their body language and into their facial expressions, but boy, that's mighty encouraging

03:32:19.690 --> 03:32:20.650
to see those smiles.

03:32:21.550 --> 03:32:26.800
We have wondered, once they got out of there, what would happen. There's been an ambulance.

03:32:27.090 --> 03:32:30.000
I don't think we can see it, so I won't ask Tom Loveless to try to do something.

03:32:30.000 --> 03:32:34.810
impossible. That ambulance has been standing by since our first crews got here, Matt Quinn

03:32:34.810 --> 03:32:39.690
and the guys a couple of nights ago. And they're ready to take her right down an alley, out

03:32:39.690 --> 03:32:43.910
to the main drag here, out to Highway 80 and over to the hospital, where I'm told they've

03:32:43.910 --> 03:32:49.530
got what they need for her there in terms of the top treatment.

03:32:49.530 --> 03:32:54.250
Our guess is she'll be there a while, if only to treat someone who's without food and water

03:32:54.250 --> 03:33:00.000
at that age or any age, 57 hours, going on 58 hours now, 57 hours and 40 minutes.

03:33:00.000 --> 03:33:05.130
and then if indeed there have been any sort of injuries whether that leg was a problem they'll

03:33:05.130 --> 03:33:10.230
have to treat all that so so she'll probably be at the hospital for a while and they're already

03:33:10.230 --> 03:33:15.460
telling the public here please come to the front entrance and just we'll give you information there

03:33:15.460 --> 03:33:21.340
and they've got a media thing all set up so they're ready we have a photographer who's been

03:33:21.340 --> 03:33:26.490
out there all day waiting and maybe he's going to get a little action it's it's looking more

03:33:26.490 --> 03:33:30.000
promising I haven't been able to see in the pictures I'm looking at any

03:33:30.000 --> 03:33:33.180
any activity around the hole. Most of the ones I've been seeing are on the couple, the

03:33:33.180 --> 03:33:37.400
McClure's. Have you seen anything new, Tracy? Well, we haven't been actually looking at

03:33:37.400 --> 03:33:41.060
the hole either, but at the couple, we're back at the hole now. It looks as though we

03:33:41.060 --> 03:33:45.830
have, I don't know, four or five people who are peering down into the hole, Dave. What

03:33:45.830 --> 03:33:49.370
they're peering at, of course, we don't know where camera's not quite that high, but I

03:33:49.370 --> 03:33:53.290
would point out that Chip McClure, it looks like, is right there, too. He's just behind

03:33:53.290 --> 03:33:59.730
them. So he's moved fairly close to the entrance of this shaft. On my monitor, we just got a

03:34:00.000 --> 03:34:02.540
from Mrs. McClure, Reba Gale, that's encouraging.

03:34:02.540 --> 03:34:04.320
- That's wonderful.

03:34:04.320 --> 03:34:07.140
- I don't know if that's just Lord knows.

03:34:07.140 --> 03:34:09.360
I still see some serious looks on some of the faces

03:34:09.360 --> 03:34:13.260
of the veteran fireman type around there.

03:34:13.260 --> 03:34:14.480
Again, you could try to read to them.

03:34:14.480 --> 03:34:16.360
I'm looking at a pulley now where they're again

03:34:16.360 --> 03:34:18.800
trying to move something up or down.

03:34:18.800 --> 03:34:21.740
So obviously they're continuing whatever effort this is.

03:34:21.740 --> 03:34:23.480
- I didn't see them put anything on the end of that thing

03:34:23.480 --> 03:34:25.020
as they were dropping it.

03:34:25.020 --> 03:34:27.080
It would appear that they're trying to retrieve something,

03:34:27.080 --> 03:34:30.000
but that's not to say, of course, that it's Jessica,

03:34:30.000 --> 03:34:32.280
but they've been passing equipment back and forth.

03:34:32.780 --> 03:34:33.740
I'm not exactly sure.

03:34:33.820 --> 03:34:37.550
I saw one fellow talking with a walkie-talkie just a little while ago.

03:34:37.650 --> 03:34:40.650
Dave, is that the way they're communicating from the top to the bottom of the shaft?

03:34:41.100 --> 03:34:41.560
Do you know?

03:34:41.560 --> 03:34:46.740
I don't know, but Tom Loveless is shaking his head that they are.

03:34:46.860 --> 03:34:49.560
I know that earlier today they kind of went through the area here and said,

03:34:50.090 --> 03:34:53.730
oh, there's a bunch of TV people here, and many of them have walkie-talkies to communicate,

03:34:53.870 --> 03:34:56.380
and they said, please try not to use those too much

03:34:56.380 --> 03:34:58.320
because we're trying to use that for communication

03:34:58.320 --> 03:35:00.000
underground up to the ground.

03:35:00.030 --> 03:35:05.260
so I guess I'm now I'm seeing a tremendous smile on her face now I don't

03:35:05.260 --> 03:35:08.920
know what that way whatever it means it can't be bad if you see if she's in that

03:35:08.920 --> 03:35:13.120
good a mood Matt Quinn so I like first people who arrived on the scene out there

03:35:13.120 --> 03:35:16.480
as you recall we did a telephone report and one of the first things Matt told me

03:35:16.480 --> 03:35:19.360
as I was talking to him a couple of nights ago was it looks like it's just

03:35:19.360 --> 03:35:24.960
gonna be a few more hours match joined us on set here in Dallas and Matt can

03:35:24.960 --> 03:35:30.000
tell us a little bit about some of the equipment that we're seeing Matt Tracy the original plan

03:35:30.000 --> 03:35:33.660
as it stood back in the days when in the hours when they thought this would be

03:35:33.660 --> 03:35:38.450
very quick that would have been I guess I've lost track Wednesday was that

03:35:38.450 --> 03:35:46.500
paramedic and then it was going to be a fire captain would go down strap her to

03:35:46.500 --> 03:35:52.180
the board and then hold the child and the board against his chest excuse me Matt

03:35:52.180 --> 03:35:57.460
there is something moving back it looks like they just moved back behind the

03:35:57.460 --> 03:35:59.640
police line I don't know what that means

03:36:00.000 --> 03:36:02.360
- They're rushing her off, I think.

03:36:02.360 --> 03:36:03.680
I don't want to put too much into this,

03:36:03.680 --> 03:36:07.110
but I believe I just saw Mrs. McClure

03:36:07.110 --> 03:36:11.360
very quickly head away from the immediate scene.

03:36:11.360 --> 03:36:12.920
We're now on a, what we're seeing, Tracy,

03:36:12.920 --> 03:36:14.580
is a close-up of that pulley area.

03:36:16.300 --> 03:36:18.740
I don't want to read the wrong thing into this.

03:36:19.830 --> 03:36:23.980
It's possible that, it's possible

03:36:23.980 --> 03:36:25.900
that they could be heading to the ambulance.

03:36:25.900 --> 03:36:27.860
I'm hearing applauding.

03:36:27.860 --> 03:36:29.730
I don't know what that is yet.

03:36:30.190 --> 03:36:33.470
I see the police chief or fire chief whispering,

03:36:33.650 --> 03:36:36.430
putting the finger to his mouth, saying, please be quiet.

03:36:38.550 --> 03:36:41.690
We have guessed that as soon as the McClure's got the high sign,

03:36:41.770 --> 03:36:42.950
they would head for the ambulance.

03:36:43.150 --> 03:36:44.830
At least that was one of the things we surmised,

03:36:44.890 --> 03:36:47.270
and that if she's on that board they're bringing her out on,

03:36:47.310 --> 03:36:50.890
they wouldn't try to have a big emotional reunion out in front of the cameras.

03:36:51.600 --> 03:36:54.640
They don't want to delay getting to the hospital even for that.

03:36:54.640 --> 03:37:00.000
So maybe what we just, what I just saw in that rush shot of Mrs. McClure

03:37:00.700 --> 03:37:02.460
was that she's heading over there.

03:37:02.460 --> 03:37:05.020
I haven't seen her trace in the last 30 seconds

03:37:05.020 --> 03:37:06.480
while I've been talking on here.

03:37:06.480 --> 03:37:08.320
- Well, we can't see Mr. McClure either,

03:37:08.320 --> 03:37:10.100
and he was right by the neck of that hole there

03:37:10.100 --> 03:37:10.940
just a moment ago.

03:37:10.940 --> 03:37:12.180
- They moved fast.

03:37:12.180 --> 03:37:14.630
I mean, well, my concern was that--

03:37:14.630 --> 03:37:17.290
- All right, we understand oxygen just went down, Dick.

03:37:17.290 --> 03:37:18.130
- So--

03:37:18.130 --> 03:37:19.290
- Oxygen just went down, all right.

03:37:19.290 --> 03:37:21.370
- Yeah, these are all good signs, and--

03:37:21.370 --> 03:37:23.430
- I guess, although I'd like to know where they went.

03:37:23.430 --> 03:37:24.650
- Well, do you think that they would put them

03:37:24.650 --> 03:37:25.790
in the ambulance to greet her there

03:37:25.790 --> 03:37:27.120
and then ride to the hospital with her?

03:37:27.120 --> 03:37:27.960
Does that make sense?

03:37:27.960 --> 03:37:30.000
- We haven't been told that, so I'm guessing.

03:37:30.000 --> 03:37:35.060
guessing that rather than if she's conscious and she has been throughout

03:37:35.060 --> 03:37:41.090
this I'm told maybe they'd rather have her see mom and dad in the ambulance than

03:37:41.090 --> 03:37:43.850
out in front of all these people I don't know I can't I don't want to read too

03:37:43.850 --> 03:37:48.260
much into this that I'm seeing from what I'm seeing the most active activity

03:37:48.260 --> 03:37:53.910
around that that hole that I've seen in a while either men just tensed up

03:37:53.910 --> 03:38:00.000
looking down into it we've seen some hours I like seeing those smiles Dave I

03:38:00.000 --> 03:38:04.330
must say. You are seeing smiles? Well, we saw one on one fellow who turned back around. They're lowering

03:38:04.330 --> 03:38:08.650
something else. Is that the oxygen? Okay, I see the oxygen being passed away, whether that's being

03:38:08.650 --> 03:38:13.980
passed into the hole or from the hole. I don't know. I see a man holding, an EMT is holding the

03:38:13.980 --> 03:38:19.460
oxygen, which may mean that they've needed what, they've used it to what they, to the extent that

03:38:19.460 --> 03:38:24.560
they need it in the hole. It's hard for me to tell whether it was being passed out or passed in, but

03:38:24.560 --> 03:38:30.000
right now he's holding it. So maybe it came up. Maybe they're bringing some of the stuff up for use in the

03:38:30.000 --> 03:38:33.300
ambulance before they bring her up we're getting that stuff out of the way so

03:38:33.300 --> 03:38:39.430
there's no danger of anybody tripping I'm very intense activity at that hole

03:38:39.430 --> 03:38:44.970
right now pulling a rope up we can't see what's on the bottom of that rope there

03:38:44.970 --> 03:38:48.610
was something attached Bill do you see no what's going on the looks like the

03:38:48.610 --> 03:38:53.290
medical team is assembling and there's been a flurry of activity kind of a

03:38:53.290 --> 03:38:57.500
gathering sense of anticipation around the around the shaft did you see where

03:38:57.500 --> 03:39:00.000
the McClure's went on our monitor here they simply

03:39:00.000 --> 03:39:03.760
rushed away. We were thinking maybe to the ambulance, maybe someplace else.

03:39:03.820 --> 03:39:07.550
Do you have anything you can say? I could not. I saw that they left. I couldn't see them

03:39:07.550 --> 03:39:10.450
anymore. I don't know where they've gone, but they've been assembling something

03:39:10.450 --> 03:39:15.250
near the edge of the entrance to the shaft. Apparently

03:39:15.250 --> 03:39:19.860
it could be a stretcher. I can't tell, but there's a nurse there. There's a doctor. A medical team

03:39:19.860 --> 03:39:23.790
is standing right on the edge of the opening now.

03:39:23.790 --> 03:39:26.710
A lot of people smiling and looking very intently

03:39:26.710 --> 03:39:29.960
down into the shaft as if they're

03:39:30.160 --> 03:39:32.960
they're expecting something we're wondering if perhaps they had freed the

03:39:32.960 --> 03:39:36.910
trial we have not confirmed that but uh did you hear that little burst of

03:39:36.910 --> 03:39:40.190
applause or somebody screaming happily i did and i there was no apparent reason

03:39:40.190 --> 03:39:44.290
for it that i could see dave uh maybe they thought she was coming out

03:39:44.290 --> 03:39:47.280
at that point and she didn't but there is uh there's a sense that

03:39:47.280 --> 03:39:51.280
something is imminent i i know my sense of direction enough

03:39:51.280 --> 03:39:54.080
here to know that the mcclure's did not rush back toward their house that they

03:39:54.080 --> 03:39:57.290
rushed in the other direction and that is where the ambulance is at

03:39:57.290 --> 03:40:00.000
least unless i'm totally messed up with the screen direction here well

03:40:00.000 --> 03:40:02.460
Well, they didn't do that necessarily voluntarily either.

03:40:02.540 --> 03:40:05.220
It looked as though someone told them to move.

03:40:05.420 --> 03:40:06.260
Yeah, let's do something.

03:40:07.620 --> 03:40:10.640
It turns out them having moved the cameras was a blessing for us

03:40:10.640 --> 03:40:13.640
because we can see more from this angle looking down

03:40:13.640 --> 03:40:15.720
than we would if we were at the level of all these fellows.

03:40:15.820 --> 03:40:18.180
We'd be seeing a lot of arms and legs and stuff.

03:40:18.340 --> 03:40:21.420
So if they did that on our behalf, we'd like to thank them.

03:40:22.840 --> 03:40:26.140
Sometimes, Tracy, in these situations, when something goes bad like this

03:40:26.140 --> 03:40:30.000
and a lot of reporters and photographers show up, some of the anger...

03:40:30.000 --> 03:40:34.680
feel at the event is transmitted to all these people running around with their

03:40:34.680 --> 03:40:38.400
walkie-talkies and saying where's my feed and time to go to the truck and all

03:40:38.400 --> 03:40:42.860
that stuff I haven't sensed much of that the people here have been very gracious

03:40:42.860 --> 03:40:47.170
to us and that's I suppose I'm saying as someone who's been here a while if I

03:40:47.170 --> 03:40:50.350
don't get a chance to say it again thank you to all the people that have made

03:40:50.350 --> 03:40:56.010
this a good experience for us what we're that is so totally incidental to the

03:40:56.010 --> 03:41:00.000
bottom line however which we want it to be a good experience for her again I'm

03:41:00.000 --> 03:41:02.420
I'm seeing face shots now of the fire chief,

03:41:02.420 --> 03:41:03.840
the middle of fire chief.

03:41:03.840 --> 03:41:05.840
Some other people looking very intent,

03:41:05.840 --> 03:41:07.460
looking down into that hole.

03:41:07.460 --> 03:41:10.000
I know Bill Brown was saying he saw smiles.

03:41:10.000 --> 03:41:11.180
I'm not seeing that,

03:41:11.180 --> 03:41:13.540
but then we don't want to read too much into that either.

03:41:13.540 --> 03:41:19.040
We are 57 hours and 45 minutes into this event.

03:41:19.500 --> 03:41:21.200
- Police officer pulling up a smaller rope.

03:41:21.200 --> 03:41:22.700
I don't know what's on this one either.

03:41:22.700 --> 03:41:23.560
- I can't see.

03:41:23.560 --> 03:41:26.370
- He's blocking it, Dave.

03:41:26.370 --> 03:41:27.910
- Maybe somebody can,

03:41:27.910 --> 03:41:30.000
people watching can relate how long,

03:41:30.000 --> 03:41:36.920
57 hours seems in their life at any one time, this is a much longer 57 hours, the stress

03:41:36.920 --> 03:41:39.340
and the strain that these people have been under.

03:41:39.340 --> 03:41:46.030
If it's getting close to being over, I'll be interested to see what sort of reaction

03:41:46.030 --> 03:41:48.340
we get if they bring her out of here.

03:41:48.340 --> 03:41:49.680
Okay.

03:41:49.680 --> 03:41:53.920
And they're looking down intently into the hole on the channel 2 monitor we're using

03:41:53.920 --> 03:41:58.640
here, and I wish I could tell you what they're looking at or some movement, but you see

03:41:58.640 --> 03:42:00.000
anything I don't see, Trace?

03:42:00.000 --> 03:42:02.460
Not really, David. We've got probably the same shot you do.

03:42:02.540 --> 03:42:06.560
A lot of the story is told on the faces of the people who have been out there for this three-day deal, however.

03:42:06.820 --> 03:42:11.300
Matt had started to tell us about the procedure they were to follow, and I had to interrupt him there.

03:42:11.380 --> 03:42:14.520
So I may have to interrupt you again, Matt, but jump back in, please.

03:42:14.960 --> 03:42:15.920
That's quite all right, Tracy.

03:42:16.400 --> 03:42:20.880
I suspect the procedure they were originally going to use may still prevail, but the faces are different.

03:42:21.020 --> 03:42:29.140
At any rate, I was saying that they will strap her to this board to ensure against worsening any spinal injuries she might have.

03:42:29.640 --> 03:42:30.000
then

03:42:30.000 --> 03:42:36.520
and the paramedic will clasp the baby and the board against his or her chest

03:42:36.520 --> 03:42:38.500
and would be hauled up that way.

03:42:38.930 --> 03:42:41.810
So that's the way they would actually get her to the surface.

03:42:41.950 --> 03:42:45.010
So you're saying the paramedic would come up at the same time, simultaneously with the child?

03:42:45.010 --> 03:42:49.650
In other words, she would be in the paramedic's arms as he came up the hole, yes.

03:42:49.890 --> 03:42:51.990
They'd be pulled up, of course, with the crane.

03:42:52.670 --> 03:42:56.010
Now, we were assuming a little earlier with the two, the large rope,

03:42:56.050 --> 03:43:00.000
One looks like a steel cable and the other one a somewhat smaller roll.

03:43:00.000 --> 03:43:01.340
that one was used for equipment,

03:43:01.440 --> 03:43:02.320
the other one for people.

03:43:02.500 --> 03:43:03.460
That's accurate, yes.

03:43:03.900 --> 03:43:07.080
The cable that you can see there

03:43:07.080 --> 03:43:09.340
with the kind of kink in it

03:43:09.340 --> 03:43:12.260
is usually the cable they use to pull people up.

03:43:12.580 --> 03:43:14.990
And obviously it's not being used

03:43:14.990 --> 03:43:16.190
when you see that kink in it.

03:43:16.830 --> 03:43:18.670
Tracy, I'm struck by something.

03:43:18.770 --> 03:43:20.390
I'm looking over at the Channel 2 monitor.

03:43:20.490 --> 03:43:21.690
We have a much smaller one here.

03:43:21.770 --> 03:43:24.590
The role that television broadcasting plays

03:43:24.590 --> 03:43:26.730
in being able to show these things to people immediately.

03:43:27.380 --> 03:43:30.000
There must be 50 or so people who've been here

03:43:30.000 --> 03:43:31.980
for a while gathered around the monitors

03:43:31.980 --> 03:43:34.100
watching on

03:43:34.100 --> 03:43:35.620
television what is happening

03:43:35.620 --> 03:43:38.150
15 to 20, 30 feet

03:43:38.150 --> 03:43:40.210
behind them. They got a better view on

03:43:40.210 --> 03:43:42.580
it, in this particular case from the ABC

03:43:42.580 --> 03:43:44.460
affiliate they're looking at here and from our

03:43:44.460 --> 03:43:46.660
little monitor, than they can actually

03:43:46.660 --> 03:43:48.870
being here. It's strange.

03:43:49.010 --> 03:43:50.530
They're watching television if something is

03:43:50.530 --> 03:43:52.730
happening behind them, but in this case, the cameras

03:43:52.730 --> 03:43:54.510
because of all the interest

03:43:54.510 --> 03:43:56.630
in this event are going to have a much better look at it than they do.

03:43:56.850 --> 03:43:58.050
I see them either

03:43:58.050 --> 03:44:00.000
lowering the head.

03:44:00.000 --> 03:44:04.960
lowering. That's the heavier cable. That's the people cable. Yes, it should be. And it's going

03:44:04.960 --> 03:44:10.200
back down in that hole. I saw a smile then on somebody's face. And again, we don't want to

03:44:10.200 --> 03:44:17.390
paint too much on what we're seeing in the faces. But boy, this looks encouraging, Dave. They're

03:44:17.390 --> 03:44:22.900
dropping the larger cable down very slowly. It's obviously a very delicate maneuver to get it to

03:44:22.900 --> 03:44:30.000
precisely the point where they want it, whatever they're trying to do with this thing. And some of

03:44:30.000 --> 03:44:34.710
little bit tired but also perhaps buoyed by what they're doing right now it has been a real

03:44:34.710 --> 03:44:39.100
roller coaster ride for some of these guys can matt quinn hear me or is he not hooked up yes

03:44:39.100 --> 03:44:44.200
yes i can i remember talking to you the other night when you first headed out for this you

03:44:44.200 --> 03:44:49.170
were the first person we sent and i think i remember you telling me that the wire copy at

03:44:49.170 --> 03:44:53.050
the time associated press was saying it could be any hour they get her out and i think i remember

03:44:53.050 --> 03:44:57.450
you saying well you've had a little experience with something like this before and it doesn't

03:44:57.450 --> 03:45:00.000
always as easy as it seems did you have a sense when

03:45:00.000 --> 03:45:04.040
you were here two nights ago or whenever it was, I guess you haven't been gone that long,

03:45:04.350 --> 03:45:07.470
that this could take as long as 57 hours and 50 minutes?

03:45:07.650 --> 03:45:12.330
I mean, did you ever feel that this was not as easy as the optimistic reports indicated?

03:45:12.730 --> 03:45:16.750
I think during the first night, David, we began to feel that when they would say,

03:45:16.750 --> 03:45:21.810
we're five feet away, we're four feet away, and then suddenly we're five feet away again,

03:45:22.050 --> 03:45:25.610
and the times would change and the distances would change.

03:45:26.110 --> 03:45:30.000
And you got a sense after a while that underground it was

03:45:30.090 --> 03:45:33.850
the going was much more difficult, even in terms of knowing where they were.

03:45:34.400 --> 03:45:37.940
And I think that probably that's when I began to get the feeling

03:45:37.940 --> 03:45:42.550
this would be much longer than an hour or two or three.

03:45:42.970 --> 03:45:46.110
Well, in the period of time that we have been broadcasting this,

03:45:46.490 --> 03:45:49.690
and I'm talking about the full ordeal from 10 o'clock Wednesday morning,

03:45:50.300 --> 03:45:51.940
interest around the world has picked up.

03:45:52.000 --> 03:45:55.120
And I would tell you, gentlemen, just as a point of interest to you and to our viewers,

03:45:55.120 --> 03:46:00.000
that CBS, NBC, ABC, and CNN, all of a network.

03:46:00.000 --> 03:46:05.040
works carrying this picture right now if you watch television and you watch a

03:46:05.040 --> 03:46:09.620
network program this is what you're gonna be seeing another note Tracy about

03:46:09.620 --> 03:46:12.560
about the sort of interest that's being taken to this and I suppose someone

03:46:12.560 --> 03:46:15.860
could say this is a political motive on his part but Vice President George Bush

03:46:15.860 --> 03:46:20.850
came to Texas in 1947 and settled in Midland to start his oil business his

03:46:20.850 --> 03:46:24.490
oil related business I'm told he called the family today

03:46:24.490 --> 03:46:30.000
in effect saying as one longtime Midland resident to another I want to wish you

03:46:30.000 --> 03:46:34.240
all the best. And of course, George Bush is now running for Republican nomination for president,

03:46:34.240 --> 03:46:39.330
and we could read anything we want to in that, but Bush has taken great pains to talk about the

03:46:39.330 --> 03:46:43.090
feelings he has for Midland, and apparently wherever he is today, he took time out to call

03:46:43.090 --> 03:46:49.090
the couple, the McClures, to say that his wishes and prayers were with them. So it's sort of the

03:46:49.090 --> 03:46:53.890
second highest officer in the country, and a guy who happens to know a little bit about Midland.

03:46:53.890 --> 03:46:58.130
Maybe George Bush would know something about what the rock is like around here with all his years of

03:46:59.590 --> 03:47:00.000
DRILLING.

03:47:00.000 --> 03:47:01.000
business out here.

03:47:01.000 --> 03:47:02.000
I imagine.

03:47:02.000 --> 03:47:03.000
So he has a lot of friends out there, too.

03:47:03.000 --> 03:47:06.000
I interviewed him not all that long ago, and he was talking about all of his friends still

03:47:06.000 --> 03:47:11.110
in Midland and was talking about starting the Republican Party in Midland when they could

03:47:11.110 --> 03:47:12.110
meet in a telephone booth.

03:47:12.110 --> 03:47:17.090
So he has a lot of very close ties to that area.

03:47:17.090 --> 03:47:21.540
I'm not surprised that he called, and I'm not surprised, too, to see the kind of community

03:47:21.540 --> 03:47:25.480
spirit that we're witnessing and watching everybody in the area of Midland, Odessa,

03:47:25.480 --> 03:47:30.000
pulled together to try to save this little girl's life and to help and

03:47:30.000 --> 03:47:31.100
support her family too.

03:47:31.680 --> 03:47:34.140
You can make too much of the small town or the small

03:47:34.140 --> 03:47:35.920
area pulling together, I guess. I mean, I know when

03:47:35.920 --> 03:47:37.860
the Delta crash happened in Dallas, there was

03:47:37.860 --> 03:47:40.080
all the people who lined up for blood. So that

03:47:40.080 --> 03:47:42.160
kind of thing can happen in Dallas too. Maybe it's

03:47:42.160 --> 03:47:44.240
easier to get a gauge on it in an area

03:47:44.240 --> 03:47:45.920
the size of Midland, Odessa. This is

03:47:45.920 --> 03:47:48.120
as we told you, one of our affiliate here

03:47:48.120 --> 03:47:50.190
in Midland has been

03:47:50.190 --> 03:47:52.150
broadcasting this continuously since 9 or

03:47:52.150 --> 03:47:53.870
10 o'clock this morning. And

03:47:53.870 --> 03:47:56.130
broadcasting being what it is, they wouldn't be

03:47:56.130 --> 03:47:58.090
doing that if they didn't think their viewers wanted to

03:47:58.090 --> 03:47:59.830
see it. So, um,

03:48:00.000 --> 03:48:03.580
So if the whole world of the whole country is watching,

03:48:03.580 --> 03:48:05.320
I doubt anybody is watching any more intently

03:48:05.320 --> 03:48:08.420
than the people in this town, this area.

03:48:08.420 --> 03:48:11.200
- David, did we ever find out exactly how old

03:48:11.200 --> 03:48:13.360
this well is that Jessica fell into?

03:48:13.360 --> 03:48:14.250
- No.

03:48:14.250 --> 03:48:17.210
About 15 years, they told us that the first night.

03:48:17.210 --> 03:48:20.140
They indicated they thought about 15 years old.

03:48:20.140 --> 03:48:22.920
And it goes down about 80 feet.

03:48:22.920 --> 03:48:24.480
- So we were talking a little bit earlier

03:48:24.480 --> 03:48:27.750
about the metal casing that she fell into.

03:48:27.750 --> 03:48:30.000
That would be a, that's heavy duty,

03:48:30.000 --> 03:48:32.000
metal. It's nothing they would be using today,

03:48:32.060 --> 03:48:33.980
which would be, of course, plastic. Actually, it's

03:48:33.980 --> 03:48:36.180
an 8-inch heavy-duty

03:48:36.180 --> 03:48:37.990
pipe, and it only goes down

03:48:37.990 --> 03:48:39.870
about 10 feet, and then it

03:48:39.870 --> 03:48:41.930
widens. They were calling it an

03:48:41.930 --> 03:48:43.890
erosion chamber at

03:48:43.890 --> 03:48:45.950
first, and then the pipe

03:48:45.950 --> 03:48:48.050
resumes at the bottom of that, in effect,

03:48:48.230 --> 03:48:49.930
that 20-foot-high

03:48:49.930 --> 03:48:51.390
bell-shaped erosion

03:48:51.390 --> 03:48:53.900
chamber, and then it drops down

03:48:53.900 --> 03:48:55.780
another 60 to 80 feet to the water

03:48:55.780 --> 03:48:58.400
table. I'm looking at a close-up here

03:48:58.400 --> 03:49:00.000
of a fellow in an orange hat. I think

03:49:00.040 --> 03:49:01.220
I may have red lips on this one.

03:49:01.260 --> 03:49:03.860
He was smiling and said, oh, man, I hope that's what he was saying.

03:49:03.940 --> 03:49:05.420
It looked as if he was quite happy.

03:49:05.860 --> 03:49:08.300
There's still a lot of activity right around that well.

03:49:08.440 --> 03:49:10.160
He had a fist in the air on the other side.

03:49:10.220 --> 03:49:13.400
It almost looked like one of the old power signs, Dave.

03:49:13.580 --> 03:49:15.680
And that body language speaks.

03:49:15.740 --> 03:49:16.500
He was telling us something.

03:49:16.520 --> 03:49:19.200
Maybe it's a little West Texas power pride thing we're seeing.

03:49:19.200 --> 03:49:22.760
Looks like that cable is fairly taut, Tracy.

03:49:27.280 --> 03:49:28.340
It's a signal to go up.

03:49:29.020 --> 03:49:30.000
The cable is coming up.

03:49:30.640 --> 03:49:32.640
At this point, that's the signal to come up.

03:49:32.740 --> 03:49:36.620
We're looking at hand signals is what we're doing here, trying to figure out exactly what it is.

03:49:36.620 --> 03:49:41.750
So he was calling, apparently, perhaps motioning away that they're about to raise the cable.

03:49:42.320 --> 03:49:43.540
And you can see the cut sign.

03:49:43.580 --> 03:49:45.920
It looks like you're backing a car up, and somebody says stop.

03:49:46.910 --> 03:49:49.930
And now this is getting tense.

03:49:52.960 --> 03:50:00.000
He's telling the folks who are running the pulley exactly where to stop and how much slack.

03:50:00.000 --> 03:50:06.420
and what kind of support he wants off that line that's going back down into the shaft.

03:50:06.420 --> 03:50:14.360
And at this point, Jessica McClure has been underground for 57 hours and 55 minutes,

03:50:14.360 --> 03:50:19.290
according to our account. Maybe she'll be out in less than 60. It certainly appears

03:50:19.290 --> 03:50:22.710
as if they're trying to raise her or get her up on that pilot now.

03:50:22.710 --> 03:50:26.210
Sure would like to know where the McClure's went. We haven't found that out yet, right?

03:50:26.210 --> 03:50:30.000
Well, I don't know. Bill and Brad, and I saw John McKay here, too. I'm sure they're

03:50:30.000 --> 03:50:33.400
running around trying to see what they can find out, but the fact that we haven't seen

03:50:33.400 --> 03:50:37.540
them in any of the pictures would make me think that maybe they're over at the ambulance.

03:50:37.540 --> 03:50:39.610
There's...

03:50:39.610 --> 03:50:40.610
I can't...

03:50:40.610 --> 03:50:42.910
It looks as if they're...

03:50:42.910 --> 03:50:43.910
I'm trying to tell, Trace.

03:50:43.910 --> 03:50:45.530
I don't want to...

03:50:45.530 --> 03:50:46.530
It looked as if they were pulling something up.

03:50:46.530 --> 03:50:47.530
I almost thought I saw a pallet.

03:50:47.530 --> 03:50:48.530
Yeah, the cable is coming up.

03:50:48.530 --> 03:50:53.600
It looked to me like in between those two fellows with the white shirts, I saw part

03:50:53.600 --> 03:50:56.750
of a pallet, but I don't want to read too much.

03:50:56.750 --> 03:50:58.450
You know, I could easily be wrong.

03:51:03.320 --> 03:51:09.160
This would be the conclusion of a game of hide and seek, Tracy, David, in which those little kids...

03:51:09.160 --> 03:51:15.060
Well, unfortunately, the first part of the game was hide, and for the last 57 hours and 55 minutes, the game has been seek.

03:51:15.280 --> 03:51:15.980
But the little kids thought that...

03:51:15.980 --> 03:51:20.200
Unfortunately, the seek part was a lot harder than your normal childhood game of hide and seek.

03:51:20.840 --> 03:51:22.860
The cable is coming up a little more rapidly now.

03:51:22.880 --> 03:51:23.560
Yeah, I see it now.

03:51:25.270 --> 03:51:26.590
Well, let's keep our fingers crossed.

03:51:33.840 --> 03:51:37.750
I'm seeing some relieved looking faces, but you don't want to make too much of it too soon.

03:52:33.870 --> 03:52:38.250
